  "crew": [
    {
      "name": "Mustafa Gürbüz",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7819217464::vessel::61fd3fa0-142f-11ef-802a-c928f19707e7::assets::207a71d0-bba8-11ef-b865-b7386b34a6d3/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Captain Mustafa was born near Marmaris.  Starting his yachting career in 2001, he has been working on charter yachts ever since and knows this coastline like the back of his hand. With his positive energy, good-nature and can do attitude, he is a great person to be around. In his spare time he enjoys reading and spending time with his family.  Mustafa speaks English and Turkish."
    },
    {
      "name": "Muhammet Ugar",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7819217464::vessel::61fd3fa0-142f-11ef-802a-c928f19707e7::assets::bdddb600-6b22-11f1-a8fa-c517836d8263/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Engin has been working on charter yachts in Turkey as a chef since 2005. His years of experience have made him very quick in the galley, enabling him to prepare a rich table for his guests several times a day, every day. He concentrates mainly on Turkish cuisine, with special emphasis on starters served in olive oil dressing and fresh fish main courses. He is a modest man and has a very gentle aura. He speaks Turkish and beginner level English."
    },
    {
      "name": "Sami Yılmaz",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7819217464::vessel::61fd3fa0-142f-11ef-802a-c928f19707e7::assets::d24121e0-6b22-11f1-a8fa-c517836d8263/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Sami  was born and raised in Köyceğiz. He took an interest in the yachting sector when he was working in different field . Since then, he has gained extensive experience as a deckhand and steward. He is outgoing and his professional attitude makes him an excellent member of the crew. He is fluent in English and Turkish, \n"
    },
    {
      "name": "Berkay Sazaklı",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7819217464::vessel::61fd3fa0-142f-11ef-802a-c928f19707e7::assets::0e0804f0-6b23-11f1-a8fa-c517836d8263/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Berkay is from the Mediterranean town of Marmaris. He started to work in yachts after high school has always been interested in the sea.  , he moved on to luxury charter vessels as a deckhand where he has proved to be a calm and customer orientated crew member.  Berkay is fluent in  Turkish. "
    },
    {
      "name": "Beytullah Dumanlı",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7819217464::vessel::61fd3fa0-142f-11ef-802a-c928f19707e7::assets::7f0e0a50-6b23-11f1-af68-3b40adce7342/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Beytullah , born in 2006, joined Always Smile in 2026 and is one of the youngest crew members.  Always Smile is his first experience onboard a luxury charter vessel and since the beginning he has demonstrated exceptional performance through his proactive approach towards both the daily upkeep of the vessel and the preparations for charters. He is a very kind young man and is always ready to help with a smile. "
    },
    {
      "name": "Deniz Sümer",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7819217464::vessel::61fd3fa0-142f-11ef-802a-c928f19707e7::assets::cde3c5c0-6b23-11f1-ac76-8bad7c6b0cf3/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Deniz was born in 1999 in the coastal town of Mersin.  After studying at University, Deniz preferred a life at sea rather than in an office. Deniz qualified as deckhand in 2024 joining Always Smile as the second Steward in 2025.  In his spare time Deniz loves to read, watch movies, play piano and listen to American pop and rock music. \nDeniz speaks English and Turkish.\n"
    }
  ],
